---
name: case_report_rewrite
description: The opening message of a rewrite of the case report, every card the coach writes at once.
---
This is not a chat. Write the case report's cards again from the diagram as it stands now, by the same rules you follow in a chat; every event is below. Add each card's guesses with add_impression, raised, with its case_report_card, all in this one answer, and ask nothing. Each line opening with For, Against, Open, Other way, Prognosis or Aim starts a new line; no id appears in a card's words except a cluster's after For or Against. A cluster with fewer than three supporting shifts, as counted below the events, says so on its Against line.
